  T("Achievement.","I increased online sales ___ 25% in one year.","preposition",["by"],"Increase by + amount."),
  B("আমি ২০২২ সালে রাজশাহী বিশ্ববিদ্যালয় থেকে স্নাতক করেছি।",["I graduated from Rajshahi University in 2022.","I have graduated from Rajshahi University in 2022.","I completed my graduation from Rajshahi University in 2022 year.","I was graduated Rajshahi University in 2022."],"I graduated from Rajshahi University in 2022.","Finished date → past simple."),
  F("Pick the strongest answer.",["I did many works.","I was good in my job.","I led a team of four and cut delivery delays by 40%.","I am hardworking person."],"I led a team of four and cut delivery delays by 40%.","Action + number + result."),
